  "totalBlocks": 18,
  "translatedBlocks": 18,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "06c9e8e4fa2f25eb",
      "translationZh": "我想分享一下我的成功配置：在一张消费级 16GB GPU（RTX 4070 Ti SUPER）上运行 Qwen 3.8 27B 模型，并使用超大的上下文窗口。目标是在不牺牲质量或速度的前提下，将所有内容装入显存。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a957a2ffdcc471fb",
      "translationZh": "模型：Hugging Face 上 jrell 提供的 Qwen3.8-27B-i1-IQ4_XS-GGUF-Smaller。这是一种定制的混合量化方案，专门用于在 16GB 显存预算内容纳多 token 预测（MTP）和长上下文。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "44d3b4706247a7d4",
      "translationZh": "聊天模板：我使用了 peculiar-ragdoll 的 Qwen-Sharp-Chat-Templates 中的 Jinja 模板。它有助于减少思考 token 的使用量，同时不会明显影响质量，这对提升速度很有帮助。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "9bfa5f8d2fa7883b",
      "translationZh": "推理引擎：这一点至关重要。我使用了 beellama.cpp（GitHub 链接），因为它支持 kvarn KV 缓存类型，而这些缓存类型是此次优化的关键。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "0d008aae6dc99a3a",
      "translationZh": "🖥️ 优化后的 llama-server 命令（Windows）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "72068f97238b4b4c",
      "translationZh": "这是我正在运行的、经过完善的命令。诀窍在于 kvarn 缓存设置和尾部精度。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "c147146e50fdaa5e",
      "translationZh": "📊 结果与优化说明",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "deb5ac60a1d1a4f0",
      "translationZh": "对于一个 27B 稠密模型而言，表现非常出色。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c36a3ae819ea0965",
      "translationZh": "通过优化缓存，成功在 88k 的基础上进一步提升。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e5c20ab92ed16b0d",
      "translationZh": "精心调校至极限，以获得最大的上下文容量。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8e8a03be32ed66bb",
      "translationZh": "使用 beellama 中的 kvarn 类型。这种非对称组合兼顾了内存占用和质量。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7aa19b92b3010cf8",
      "translationZh": "这是关键。它以更高精度保留最近的 token，从而维持输出质量。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b11eb46b21f58882",
      "translationZh": "KV 缓存量化：从 kvarn5/kvarn5 改为 kvarn5/kvarn4，节省了约 6% 的 VRAM，使上下文大小得以从 88k 增加到 100k，同时质量损失极小。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "98281320c5cb465a",
      "translationZh": "批次大小：设置 --batch-size 1024 和 --ubatch-size 256，以平衡提示词处理速度与 VRAM 占用。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "86940c90e109db47",
      "translationZh": "线程设置：针对我的 Ryzen 7 CPU，调整为 --threads 7 和 --threads-batch 8。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "409cb0d616c3d411",
      "translationZh": "推测解码：使用 --spec-type draft-mtp，并设置 2 个草稿 token（该模型支持此功能），带来了巨大的速度提升。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6f77b2373554357e",
      "translationZh": "用于 KV cache 的近乎无损的 kvarn 量化才是这里真正的亮点。它以 q4 级别的内存占用实现了 q5 级别的保真度，令人惊叹。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "71d54104bf8d8152",
      "translationZh": "希望这能帮助所有想从一张 16GB 显卡中榨出最大性能的人！祝好。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
  "wordWise": [
    {
